{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":18099775,"ns":0,"title":"Desander","extract":"Desanders and desilters are solid control equipment with a set of hydrocyclones that separate sand and silt from the drilling fluids in drilling rigs. Desanders are installed on top of the mud tank following the shale shaker and the degasser, but before the desilter.","description":"Equipment that separate sand and silt from the drilling fluids","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}